    <section class="section approach" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">02 / MY APPROACH</p><p>The workflow matters.<br>So do the details around it.</p></div><h2 id="approach-title">Useful first.<br><em>Thoughtful throughout.</em></h2><div class="approach-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Start with the work.</h3><p>Map what happens today, where information gets lost, and which repetitive steps are worth automating.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Build the connections.</h3><p>Bring tools and records together. Design for duplicate data, missing details, retries and the moments that need a person.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Test the whole journey.</h3><p>Check what goes in, what comes out, and what happens when something fails. Make the system’s actions visible.</p></article></div></section>
